#. Description of the plugin
#: millicache.php
msgid ""
"The most flexible Full Page Cache for scaling WordPress sites. Enterprise-"
"grade in-memory store with Redis, ValKey, Dragonfly, KeyDB, or any "
"alternative."
msgstr ""
"Der flexibelste Full-Page-Cache für skalierende WordPress-Websites. In-"
"Memory-Speicher auf Enterprise-Niveau mit Redis, ValKey, Dragonfly, KeyDB "
"oder jeder anderen Alternative."

#. Author of the plugin
#: millicache.php
msgid "MilliPress Team"
msgstr "MilliPress Team"

